<meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"Tafsir Al-Burooj 85:1 — menurut Ibnu Taimiyah dan Ibnu al-Qayyim\">\n<meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"Demi langit yang mempunyai tempat-tempat peredaran bintang-bintang;\">\n<meta name=\"theme-color\" content=\"#1f4d3a\">\n<link rel=\"icon\" href=\"/icon.svg\" type=\"image/svg+xml\">\n<link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com\">\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Amiri+Quran&family=Amiri:wght@400;700&family=Noto+Naskh+Arabic:wght@400;600&display=swap\">\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/theme.css\">\n<style>body{font-family:system-ui,\"Segoe UI\",sans-serif;color:var(--ink);padding:20px 16px 48px;line-height:1.6}.tr{font-size:17px;line-height:1.8;margin:0}.cr{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted)}.ar{direction:rtl;text-align:right}</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<main class=\"sp\"><nav class=\"crumbs\"><a href=\"/ms/\">Laman utama</a> › <a href=\"/ms/surah/85.html\">Surah Al-Burooj</a> › Ayat 1</nav><h1>Tafsir Surah Al-Burooj 85:1</h1><p class=\"vt ar\" lang=\"ar\">﴿بِسْمِ اللَّهِ الرَّحْمَٰنِ الرَّحِيمِ وَالسَّمَاءِ ذَاتِ الْبُرُوجِ﴾</p><section><h3>Terjemahan makna</h3><p class=\"tr\">Demi langit yang mempunyai tempat-tempat peredaran bintang-bintang;</p><span class=\"cr\" dir=\"ltr\">Malay Translation - Abdullah Basumayyah — v1.0.0 · QuranEnc.com</span></section><p class=\"cr\">Kata-kata kedua-dua imam dipaparkan dalam bahasa Arab asal, kata demi kata, berserta rujukan.</p><section><h2>Imam Ibnu al-Qayyim</h2><blockquote class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\">التي تنزلها الشمس والقمر وفسرت بالنجوم أو نوع منها وفسرت بالقصور العظام وكل ذلك من آيات قدرته وشواهد وحدانيته<cite>«التبيان في أقسام القرآن» 1/88</cite></blockquote></section><a class=\"btn pri open\" href=\"/tafsir.html?lang=ms#s85a1\">Buka dalam tafsir interaktif (teks penuh)</a><div class=\"pn\"><span></span><a href=\"/ms/ayah/85-2.html\">Ayat seterusnya (85:2)</a></div></main><footer class=\"site-foot\"><span>Tafsir al-Syaikhain · <a href=\"/ms/\">Laman utama</a> · <a href=\"/about.html\">Tentang projek</a> · <a href=\"/privacy.html\">Privasi &amp; terma</a></span><a href=\"https://doersadv.com\" rel=\"noopener\" dir=\"ltr\">Developed by Doers</a></footer>\n</body>\n</html>\n","ayah/85-2.html":"<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"ms\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n<title>Tafsir Al-Burooj 85:2 — menurut Ibnu Taimiyah dan Ibnu al-Qayyim</title>\n<meta name=\"description\" content=\"Dan hari (pembalasan) yang dijanjikan;\">\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ms/ayah/85-2.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ar\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ayah/85-2.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"x-default\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ayah/85-2.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"en\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/en/ayah/85-2.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ur\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ur/ayah/85-2.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"id\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/id/ayah/85-2.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"tr\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/tr/ayah/85-2.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"fr\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/fr/ayah/85-2.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"bn\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/bn/ayah/85-2.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ms\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ms/ayah/85-2.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"fa\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/fa/ayah/85-2.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ru\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ru/ayah/85-2.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"sw\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/sw/ayah/85-2.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ha\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ha/ayah/85-2.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"es\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/es/ayah/85-2.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"de\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/de/ayah/85-2.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"zh\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/zh/ayah/85-2.html\">\n<meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"Tafsir Al-Burooj 85:2 — menurut Ibnu Taimiyah dan Ibnu al-Qayyim\">\n<meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"Dan hari (pembalasan) yang dijanjikan;\">\n<meta name=\"theme-color\" content=\"#1f4d3a\">\n<link rel=\"icon\" href=\"/icon.svg\" type=\"image/svg+xml\">\n<link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com\">\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Amiri+Quran&family=Amiri:wght@400;700&family=Noto+Naskh+Arabic:wght@400;600&display=swap\">\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/theme.css\">\n<style>body{font-family:system-ui,\"Segoe UI\",sans-serif;color:var(--ink);padding:20px 16px 48px;line-height:1.6}.tr{font-size:17px;line-height:1.8;margin:0}.cr{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted)}.ar{direction:rtl;text-align:right}</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<main class=\"sp\"><nav class=\"crumbs\"><a href=\"/ms/\">Laman utama</a> › <a href=\"/ms/surah/85.html\">Surah Al-Burooj</a> › Ayat 2</nav><h1>Tafsir Surah Al-Burooj 85:2</h1><p class=\"vt ar\" lang=\"ar\">﴿وَالْيَوْمِ الْمَوْعُودِ﴾</p><section><h3>Terjemahan makna</h3><p class=\"tr\">Dan hari (pembalasan) yang dijanjikan;</p><span class=\"cr\" dir=\"ltr\">Malay Translation - Abdullah Basumayyah — v1.0.0 · QuranEnc.com</span></section><p class=\"cr\">Kata-kata kedua-dua imam dipaparkan dalam bahasa Arab asal, kata demi kata, berserta rujukan.</p><section><h2>Imam Ibnu al-Qayyim</h2><blockquote class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\">ثم أقسم باليوم الموعود وهو يوم القيامة وهو المقسم به وعليه<cite>«التبيان في أقسام القرآن» 1/89</cite></blockquote></section><a class=\"btn pri open\" href=\"/tafsir.html?lang=ms#s85a2\">Buka dalam tafsir interaktif (teks penuh)</a><div class=\"pn\"><a href=\"/ms/ayah/85-1.html\">Ayat sebelumnya (85:1)</a><a href=\"/ms/ayah/85-10.html\">Ayat seterusnya (85:10)</a></div></main><footer class=\"site-foot\"><span>Tafsir al-Syaikhain · <a href=\"/ms/\">Laman utama</a> · <a href=\"/about.html\">Tentang projek</a> · <a href=\"/privacy.html\">Privasi &amp; terma</a></span><a href=\"https://doersadv.com\" rel=\"noopener\" dir=\"ltr\">Developed by Doers</a></footer>\n</body>\n</html>\n","ayah/85-10.html":"<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"ms\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n<title>Tafsir Al-Burooj 85:10 — menurut Ibnu Taimiyah dan Ibnu al-Qayyim</title>\n<meta name=\"description\" content=\"Sesungguhnya orang-orang yang menimpakan bencana untuk memesongkan orang-orang lelaki yang beriman dan orang-orang perempuan yang beriman, kemudian mereka \">\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ms/ayah/85-10.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ar\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ayah/85-10.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"x-default\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ayah/85-10.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"en\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/en/ayah/85-10.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ur\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ur/ayah/85-10.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"id\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/id/ayah/85-10.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"tr\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/tr/ayah/85-10.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"fr\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/fr/ayah/85-10.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"bn\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/bn/ayah/85-10.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ms\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ms/ayah/85-10.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"fa\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/fa/ayah/85-10.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ru\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ru/ayah/85-10.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"sw\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/sw/ayah/85-10.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ha\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ha/ayah/85-10.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"es\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/es/ayah/85-10.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"de\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/de/ayah/85-10.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"zh\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/zh/ayah/85-10.html\">\n<meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"Tafsir Al-Burooj 85:10 — menurut Ibnu Taimiyah dan Ibnu al-Qayyim\">\n<meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"Sesungguhnya orang-orang yang menimpakan bencana untuk memesongkan orang-orang lelaki yang beriman dan orang-orang perempuan yang beriman, kemudian mereka \">\n<meta name=\"theme-color\" content=\"#1f4d3a\">\n<link rel=\"icon\" href=\"/icon.svg\" type=\"image/svg+xml\">\n<link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com\">\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Amiri+Quran&family=Amiri:wght@400;700&family=Noto+Naskh+Arabic:wght@400;600&display=swap\">\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/theme.css\">\n<style>body{font-family:system-ui,\"Segoe UI\",sans-serif;color:var(--ink);padding:20px 16px 48px;line-height:1.6}.tr{font-size:17px;line-height:1.8;margin:0}.cr{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted)}.ar{direction:rtl;text-align:right}</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<main class=\"sp\"><nav class=\"crumbs\"><a href=\"/ms/\">Laman utama</a> › <a href=\"/ms/surah/85.html\">Surah Al-Burooj</a> › Ayat 10</nav><h1>Tafsir Surah Al-Burooj 85:10</h1><p class=\"vt ar\" lang=\"ar\">﴿إِنَّ الَّذِينَ فَتَنُوا الْمُؤْمِنِينَ وَالْمُؤْمِنَاتِ ثُمَّ لَمْ يَتُوبُوا فَلَهُمْ عَذَابُ جَهَنَّمَ وَلَهُمْ عَذَابُ الْحَرِيقِ﴾</p><section><h3>Terjemahan makna</h3><p class=\"tr\">Sesungguhnya orang-orang yang menimpakan bencana untuk memesongkan orang-orang lelaki yang beriman dan orang-orang perempuan yang beriman, kemudian mereka tidak bertaubat, maka mereka akan beroleh azab neraka Jahannam (kerana perbuatan buruk itu), dan mereka akan beroleh lagi azab api yang kuat membakar (kerana mereka tidak bertaubat).</p><span class=\"cr\" dir=\"ltr\">Malay Translation - Abdullah Basumayyah — v1.0.0 · QuranEnc.com</span></section><p class=\"cr\">Kata-kata kedua-dua imam dipaparkan dalam bahasa Arab asal, kata demi kata, berserta rujukan.</p><section><h2>Imam Ibnu al-Qayyim</h2><blockquote class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\">فسرت الفتنة هاهنا بتعذيبهم المؤمنين، وإحراقهم إياهم بالنار، واللفظ أعم من ذلك<cite>«زاد المعاد في هدي خير العباد» 3/151</cite></blockquote><blockquote class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\">ويدعوهم إلى التوبة وقد حاربوه وعذبوا أولياءه وأحرقوهم بالنار.<cite>«طريق الهجرتين وباب السعادتين» 1/317</cite></blockquote></section><a class=\"btn pri open\" href=\"/tafsir.html?lang=ms#s85a10\">Buka dalam tafsir interaktif (teks penuh)</a><div class=\"pn\"><a href=\"/ms/ayah/85-2.html\">Ayat sebelumnya (85:2)</a><a href=\"/ms/ayah/85-14.html\">Ayat seterusnya (85:14)</a></div></main><footer class=\"site-foot\"><span>Tafsir al-Syaikhain · <a href=\"/ms/\">Laman utama</a> · <a href=\"/about.html\">Tentang projek</a> · <a href=\"/privacy.html\">Privasi &amp; terma</a></span><a href=\"https://doersadv.com\" rel=\"noopener\" dir=\"ltr\">Developed by Doers</a></footer>\n</body>\n</html>\n","ayah/85-14.html":"<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"ms\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n<title>Tafsir Al-Burooj 85:14 — menurut Ibnu Taimiyah dan Ibnu al-Qayyim</title>\n<meta name=\"description\" content=\"Dan Dia lah yang Maha Pengampun, lagi Maha Pengasih.\">\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ms/ayah/85-14.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ar\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ayah/85-14.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"x-default\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ayah/85-14.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"en\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/en/ayah/85-14.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ur\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ur/ayah/85-14.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"id\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/id/ayah/85-14.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"tr\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/tr/ayah/85-14.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"fr\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/fr/ayah/85-14.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"bn\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/bn/ayah/85-14.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ms\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ms/ayah/85-14.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"fa\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/fa/ayah/85-14.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ru\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ru/ayah/85-14.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"sw\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/sw/ayah/85-14.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ha\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ha/ayah/85-14.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"es\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/es/ayah/85-14.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"de\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/de/ayah/85-14.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"zh\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/zh/ayah/85-14.html\">\n<meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"Tafsir Al-Burooj 85:14 — menurut Ibnu Taimiyah dan Ibnu al-Qayyim\">\n<meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"Dan Dia lah yang Maha Pengampun, lagi Maha Pengasih.\">\n<meta name=\"theme-color\" content=\"#1f4d3a\">\n<link rel=\"icon\" href=\"/icon.svg\" type=\"image/svg+xml\">\n<link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com\">\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Amiri+Quran&family=Amiri:wght@400;700&family=Noto+Naskh+Arabic:wght@400;600&display=swap\">\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/theme.css\">\n<style>body{font-family:system-ui,\"Segoe UI\",sans-serif;color:var(--ink);padding:20px 16px 48px;line-height:1.6}.tr{font-size:17px;line-height:1.8;margin:0}.cr{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted)}.ar{direction:rtl;text-align:right}</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<main class=\"sp\"><nav class=\"crumbs\"><a href=\"/ms/\">Laman utama</a> › <a href=\"/ms/surah/85.html\">Surah Al-Burooj</a> › Ayat 14</nav><h1>Tafsir Surah Al-Burooj 85:14</h1><p class=\"vt ar\" lang=\"ar\">﴿وَهُوَ الْغَفُورُ الْوَدُودُ﴾</p><section><h3>Terjemahan makna</h3><p class=\"tr\">Dan Dia lah yang Maha Pengampun, lagi Maha Pengasih.</p><span class=\"cr\" dir=\"ltr\">Malay Translation - Abdullah Basumayyah — v1.0.0 · QuranEnc.com</span></section><p class=\"cr\">Kata-kata kedua-dua imam dipaparkan dalam bahasa Arab asal, kata demi kata, berserta rujukan.</p><section><h2>Syeikhul Islam Ibnu Taimiyah</h2><h3>Apa yang beliau nukilkan daripada orang lain</h3><blockquote class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\"><span class=\"who\">قيل</span> <span class=\"st\">حكاه</span> «معناه المودود؛ كالحلوب، والركوب؛ بمعنى المحلوب والمركوب»<cite>«النبوات» 1/362</cite></blockquote><blockquote class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\"><span class=\"who\">قيل</span> <span class=\"st\">حكاه</span> «يغفر، ويود أن يغفر»<cite>«النبوات» 1/362</cite></blockquote><blockquote class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\"><span class=\"who\">قيل</span> <span class=\"st\">حكاه</span> «المتودد إلى أوليائه بالمغفرة»<cite>«النبوات» 1/362</cite></blockquote></section><a class=\"btn pri open\" href=\"/tafsir.html?lang=ms#s85a14\">Buka dalam tafsir interaktif (teks penuh)</a><div class=\"pn\"><a href=\"/ms/ayah/85-10.html\">Ayat sebelumnya (85:10)</a><a href=\"/ms/ayah/85-22.html\">Ayat seterusnya (85:22)</a></div></main><footer class=\"site-foot\"><span>Tafsir al-Syaikhain · <a href=\"/ms/\">Laman utama</a> · <a href=\"/about.html\">Tentang projek</a> · <a href=\"/privacy.html\">Privasi &amp; terma</a></span><a href=\"https://doersadv.com\" rel=\"noopener\" dir=\"ltr\">Developed by Doers</a></footer>\n</body>\n</html>\n","ayah/85-